    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "12BB275357DBC9ED",
      "text": "欢迎来到圆模道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "12BB245357DBC4D4",
      "text": "我要登记一下\\n挑战者的名字……\\r\\n你是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，没错吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "12BB255357DBC687",
      "text": "想和本道馆的\\n馆主阿枫对战，\\r\\n需要先通过道馆测验才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "12BB225357DBC16E",
      "text": "圆模道馆的道馆测验是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]滚橄榄[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_history",
      "hash64": "1D34FC39E3AF567A",
      "text": "在橄榄的产地圆模，\\n人们为了盼望丰收，\\r\\n一直以来都会举办橄榄丰收祭。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "12BB235357DBC321",
      "text": "只要滚动模仿橄榄制成的球，\\n并把它送到终点，就能通过道馆测验。\\r\\n来年能采到很多橄榄的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "12BB205357DBBE08",
      "text": "详细规则请去问\\n会场内的工作人员吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_010_receptionist_map",
      "hash64": "DFC4229CB253ADF4",
      "text": "滚橄榄会场\\n在[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]镇子的北边[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\r\\n让我把位置添加到地图上吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
